  "strongest_verified_claim": "The explicit transvection x4 -> x4w gives D_n(5) minus A_n(5) for every n>=4; x3 -> x3v gives D_n(6) minus A_n(6) for every n>=3. D uses the full J/J^(k+1) of the rational SL(2,C) matrix-entry algebra; A uses integral lower-central quotients. This refutes the all-degrees equality as formulated in the original 2018 OWR source.",
